inatory power for detecting ligand interface positions. Our work highlights the utility of large-scale mutagenesis data, and our conclusions can help guide future mutagenesis studies.","topics":[],"score":1940.0,"global_rank":335947},{"name":"clarketm/HackerRank-SQL","owner":"clarketm","html_url":"https://github.com/clarketm/HackerRank-SQL","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"HackerRank SQL Solutions","topics":["hackerrank","solutions","sql"],"score":1940.0,"global_rank":335948},{"name":"sangregoriokimpo/frozen-warehouse-simulator","owner":"sangregoriokimpo","html_url":"https://github.com/sangregoriokimpo/frozen-warehouse-simulator","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"made this for the 2024 Crimson Game Jam","topics":[],"score":1940.0,"global_rank":335951},{"name":"Timidger/treant","owner":"Timidger","html_url":"https://github.com/Timidger/treant","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Rust","description":"A collection of trees implemented without using PetGraph","topics":[],"score":1940,"global_rank":335952},{"name":"ardulat/nuspesc","owner":"ardulat","html_url":"https://github.com/ardulat/nuspesc","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":"NU SPE SC","topics":[],"score":1940,"global_rank":335954},{"name":"banlong/GoXML","owner":"banlong","html_url":"https://github.com/banlong/GoXML","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Go","description":"XML manipulation with Golang","topics":[],"score":1940,"global_rank":335955},{"name":"naasir/archetype","owner":"naasir","html_url":"https://github.com/naasir/archetype","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Scala","description":"A type, event and domain driven modeling exercise of platonic proportions.","topics":[],"score":1940,"global_rank":335980},{"name":"shirhatti/RTOS-robot","owner":"shirhatti","html_url":"https://github.com/shirhatti/RTOS-robot","stars":